<https://schema.org/affiliation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>;
                                 rdfs:comment "Eine Organisation, der eine Person angehört"@de,
                                              "An organization that this person is affiliated with. For example, a school/university, a club, or a team."@en;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "changed by m4i: use of skos:prefLabel instead of rdfs:label, added German label, added language tag to English label"@en,
